{"unit_id":"Yujm888__dsh-turn-rail#card-zh","repo":"Yujm888/dsh-turn-rail","commit":"f9d4b290bcac8343e389f8d2ee5a0d392a95e743","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-rail（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为长对话提供轮次导航栏，方便快速定位和搜索用户消息。插件在会话投影中记录用户消息，并将导航控件接入对话输入区域。用户可从屏幕右侧边缘唤出轮次标记，悬停预览消息和时间，点击标记跳回对应消息；也可搜索本会话文本并从结果跳转。超过 30 轮时导航栏可内部滚动，并标出当前阅读位置。适合需要在长会话中回看或查找提问的 DSH Web 用户。需要支持 sessionProjections 的 DSH Web profile，不需要额外密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:23-68","lib/client.js:153-180","lib/client.js:366-374","lib/client.js:433-438","lib/client.js:485-515"]}
{"unit_id":"Yujm888__dsh-turn-rail#card-en","repo":"Yujm888/dsh-turn-rail","commit":"f9d4b290bcac8343e389f8d2ee5a0d392a95e743","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-turn-rail adds a turn rail to DSH Web chats. It records user turns and shows markers with message previews and times. Click a marker or search the session to jump to a message. Long chats scroll within the rail. Requires a Web profile with sessionProjections; no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:23-68","lib/client.js:153-180","lib/client.js:366-374","lib/client.js:433-438","lib/client.js:485-515"]}
